If you want to run differnet workloads (e.g. matrix multiplication with differnet dimentions), 

For example: 512x512x512 
1. cp src/tiled_matmul_cpu-paralell.c src/tiled_matmul_cpu-paralell-512.c
2. open file "src/tiled_matmul_cpu-paralell-512.c" and change the line in Line5:
    #define DIM 512
    
3. open file Makefile, add line: 
   gcc  src/tiled_matmul_cpu-paralell-512.c -g -o bin/tiled_matmul_cpu_512-paralell.x86 -static -lm -lpthread -fPIC
4. run:
    make 